ocumentation"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"**English**"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- Public API and query guide"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"**简体中文**"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- 公开 API 与查询指南"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Getting started"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Then open http://localhost:4321."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Regenerating plugin data"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Plugins from the GitHub topic `dsh-plugin` are synced daily into the project database; the static sn"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"apshots (plugin library, homepage rails) are generated from it. To regenerate the snapshots only (ne"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"eds database credentials in `.env.local`):"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"To run a full refresh — GitHub sync, download counts, install methods, snapshots, build check — and "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"commit only the generated files:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Submit your plugin"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Add the `dsh-plugin` topic to your **public** GitHub repository. A scheduled job syncs the topic eve"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ry day at 02:17 UTC, so a newly tagged repo shows up in the marketplace within about a day — no issu"},{"id":"p26s3","text":" UTC, so a newly tagged repo shows up in the marketplace within about a day — no issue or PR needed."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"If it still isn't listed after two syncs, open an issue: the repo may have been filtered as off-topi"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"c, or it may be private/archived."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Contributing"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Issues and PRs are welcome:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- Lessons live in `src/content/lessons` as MDX.\n- UI strings live in `messages/`."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"## Friend links"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"- DSH Desktop — a modern desktop app for the DeepSeek Harness (DSH) plugin ecosystem (GitHub)\n- MZYA"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"I GEO (妙智云) — an open-source GEO platform that gets your site accurately cited and recommended in AI"},{"id":"p32s3","text":" answers from DeepSeek, Kimi, Doubao, GLM, Hunyuan and more (GitHub)"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
